    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiniclick is a relaxing <strong>incremental</strong> game (or not\u2014it's up to you) where your goal is to pay off an unfair debt to\u00a0the\u00a0Fun\u00a0Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/a6f7961a33a59e769865b364a137aa0f.avif?t=1750413456\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/972fd10f3b32f7689a01904ad683da5d.poster.avif?t=1750413456\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/972fd10f3b32f7689a01904ad683da5d.webm?t=1750413456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/972fd10f3b32f7689a01904ad683da5d.mp4?t=1750413456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each program comes with upgrades that will allow you to earn more money\u00a0with\u00a0them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/c876f6e8674d1a44ded0b8b787ec7a25.avif?t=1750413456\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/a0d058ce809fca2b07f48c9de93bb0ce.poster.avif?t=1750413456\" width=642 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/a0d058ce809fca2b07f48c9de93bb0ce.webm?t=1750413456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/a0d058ce809fca2b07f48c9de93bb0ce.mp4?t=1750413456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some programs will require resources from others\u00a0to\u00a0run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/7a7f8abb1568e58f05432bea5569a4c7.avif?t=1750413456\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/9d14ad0cbae7ab4f75a5d1b9b64a7037.poster.avif?t=1750413456\" width=750 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/9d14ad0cbae7ab4f75a5d1b9b64a7037.webm?t=1750413456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/9d14ad0cbae7ab4f75a5d1b9b64a7037.mp4?t=1750413456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a bit of creativity, you can even automate parts of\u00a0the\u00a0process!</p></li></ul>",
